{"__q": {"t": "Настоящие времена — Сборник 1", "q": [{"s": "Choose the correct form: «She ___ to school every day.»", "o": ["going", "go", "goes", "gone"], "e": "Present Simple, в 3-м лице единственного числа добавляется «-s»."}, {"s": "Complete: «They ___ football now.»", "o": ["are playing", "plays", "played", "play"], "e": "«Now» требует Present Continuous."}, {"s": "Choose: «I ___ here since 2020.»", "o": ["live", "have lived", "lived", "am living"], "e": "С «since» употребляется Present Perfect."}, {"s": "Complete: «He ___ never been to Paris.»", "o": ["has", "was", "have", "is"], "e": "В 3-м лице единственного числа употребляется «has»."}, {"s": "Which is Present Simple negative?", "o": ["She doesn't like it.", "She don't like it.", "She not like it.", "She isn't like it."], "e": "В 3-м лице единственного числа употребляется «doesn't»."}, {"s": "Complete: «Look! It ___ .»", "o": ["has rained", "is raining", "rains", "rained"], "e": "«Look!» указывает на настоящий момент."}, {"s": "Choose: «Water ___ at 100 degrees.»", "o": ["is boiling", "boil", "boils", "boiled"], "e": "Научные факты выражаются в Present Simple."}, {"s": "Complete: «I ___ my homework already.»", "o": ["have finished", "finish", "finished", "finishing"], "e": "«Already» употребляется с Present Perfect."}, {"s": "Which sentence is correct?", "o": ["He is knowing the answer.", "He know the answer.", "He knowing the answer.", "He knows the answer."], "e": "«Know» — глагол состояния (state verb), в Continuous не употребляется."}, {"s": "Complete: «How long ___ you ___ English?»", "o": ["do / study", "are / studying", "have / been studying", "did / study"], "e": "«How long» требует Present Perfect Continuous."}]}, "Present Tenses — 1-ci toplu": "Настоящие времена — Сборник 1"}